# Keep CLI deploys small — local DB and build artifacts stay off Vercel uploads.
# Patterns MUST stay anchored: Vercel applies this file to git-connected
# deploys too (repo-wide), so a bare `data` also matched src/app/api/data/
# and the backup/restore API routes 404'd on every deployment.
/data
edgeways/data
.next
node_modules
/coverage
*.db
*.db-*
.env*
!.env.example
# Engineering/strategy markdown is not needed on the builder for CLI uploads.
# (Git-connected deploys still clone the monorepo; Root Directory is edgeways/.)
/docs
/PLAN.md
